cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its visualizations in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Math Viz Atlas · 数学可视化图谱"
abstract: >-
  An interactive mathematical visualization atlas built with DeepSeek Harness.
  It covers primary-school arithmetic through university-level single-variable
  calculus with 19 interactive modules, a free-form expression sandbox with a
  live calculus engine (symbolic differentiation, antiderivatives, definite
  integrals, numerical limits and constant perturbation), a narrative auto-play
  demo system, and a zero-build, zero-CDN static architecture.
authors:
